# Build output
out/
*.class

# Downloaded SNAP graphs, ~13 MB, regenerable. See REPORT.md section 9 for the
# curl commands. The hand-built toy graph and all query sets ARE committed, so
# the reported numbers reproduce exactly without regenerating any query file.
data/*.el
data/*.gz

# Generated results. Only the artifacts REPORT.md cites are kept: the figures
# and the per-query CSVs. Index dumps and raw query output are large and
# regenerable. The re-include dance is required because excluding a directory
# stops git descending into it at all.
results/*
!results/*/
results/*/*
!results/*/sweep.csv
!results/*/sweep.png
!results/*/bench.csv
